<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten feed steady to lower, meal flat.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten feed steady to lower, meal flat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn gluten feed prices were steady to weaker and meal values were flat with light demand noted, several cash dealers said.</p>
<p>CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars per short ton)</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  115.00     dn 2</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  unq</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  343.00	unc</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -  112.00	unc</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  320.00	unc</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
